# Not written:
#   DMZ to Internet - GRE-Tunnel: its services cannot be written: an ICMP type, ICMPv6, SCTP or another IP protocol: a custom service of Cato is TCP, UDP or ICMP
#   DMZ to Internet - Legacy-App: its services cannot be written: references 'Legacy-App': an entry with 'sourceport', which this parser does not read
#   DMZ to LAN - vpn.ipsec: its services cannot be written: an ICMP type, ICMPv6, SCTP or another IP protocol: a custom service of Cato is TCP, UDP or ICMP
